Z||000006||sqoach||11-12-2001||11:32 PM||||I'm thinking of getting one. Not sure if I should wait or not, though. Glad to hear a good review of it. Haven't heard anything bad. Except they keep pushing the dates back. It was first scheduled to come out in late summer. Last I've heard, it's the 18th. I think it is about $200. I think you can get the console in black, or blue. I sure hope it's as good as what I've read and seen on the net. Seen a bunch of demos for a lot of the games. Looks really cool. The graphics are amazing over the N64!<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>               <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif">              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">               <BR>^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 SC 2.5L 5spd</FONT>||||reg||14
