Z||000009||Flamberge||11-14-2001||12:47 AM||||I like the X-box (since I sort of work for Microsoft) and it has the best controller for gaming I have ever handled. Throw in Madden 2002 and I am tempted....however<P>The PS2 has Madden 2002 and NCAA 2002 and the new Kinetica, which looks VERY cool. (Anyone played it?) It also has Red Faction (underrated IMO) etc etc.<P>The Game Cube ("Dead Dolphin") doesn't really interest me because of Nintendo's theme of catering more to kids. (Nothing wrong with that, it just doesn't help me.)<P><P>------------------<BR>- Flamberge<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://flamberge.iwarp.com/Serra3sm.jpg"> ||||reg||7
